{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/猎宴","pageid":8491,"revid":21055,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8C%8E%E5%AE%B4&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8C%8E%E5%AE%B4&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E7%8C%8E%E5%AE%B4&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>猎宴</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E7.8C.8E.E5.AE.B4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"猎宴\"><b>猎宴</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"技能 猎宴.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ea/l64c8hk65svzo719ufu25dgjjlhu6wp.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%8C%8E%E5%AE%B4.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/ea/l64c8hk65svzo719ufu25dgjjlhu6wp.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E7%8C%8E%E5%AE%B4.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/ea/l64c8hk65svzo719ufu25dgjjlhu6wp.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />猎宴\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[被动]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（被动）行动开始时，若自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">6</font>格内存在敌人，自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"猎物的味道\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"blue\">猎物的味道</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲暴击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲暴击2</font></span></span>]，所有效果持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合，且获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"锋芒\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">锋芒</font></span></span>]。效果冷却2回合。<br />✦主动攻击时，伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%98%BF%E5%8A%A0%E5%A1%94%E2%80%A2%E5%87%9B%E5%86%AC%E6%9E%81%E6%98%9F\" title=\"角色图鉴库/阿加塔•凛冬极星\"><img alt=\"头像 阿加塔•凛冬极星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1b/6uwrip42fpim5p1wbon2zaut4c4ot5q.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">阿加塔•凛冬极星</font></div>\n</div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门内</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\">关联内容\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left;\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022164247\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.384 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.512 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 9487/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 154569/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6816/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  495.930      1 模板:简单技能\n100.00%  495.930      1 -total\n  7.23%   35.841      1 模板:中括号介绍化\n  6.64%   32.947      3 模板:中括号介绍\n  1.79%    8.864      1 模板:面包屑\n  0.97%    4.833      1 模板:列表/头像\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:8491-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022164247 and revision id 21055. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"技能","missing":true}],"images":["技能_猎宴.png","头像_阿加塔•凛冬极星.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"<b>猎宴</b>","number":"1","index":"T-1","fromtitle":"模板:简单技能","byteoffset":null,"anchor":"猎宴"}],"displaytitle":"技能图鉴库/猎宴","wikitext":"{{简单技能\n|技能名称=猎宴\n|技能图标=猎宴\n|显示名称=\n|技能类别=被动\n|技能描述=（被动）行动开始时，若自身范围<font color=#ed7950>6</font>格内存在敌人，自身获得[<fon